PROJECT: ADVANCED AI PERSONAL WALLPAPER & TYPOGRAPHY STUDIO

Professional AI Image Generation | Dual Reference Identity | Bengali & English Typography | Android Mobile-First

1. PROJECT VISION

Upgrade the existing AI Android Wallpaper Generator into a premium, professional AI Image Generation Studio.

The application must generate high-quality, photorealistic, cinematic wallpapers and graphic-designed portrait images using exactly TWO reference images of the same individual.

The interface must be optimized primarily for Android mobile browsers.

Prioritize free-tier AI image-generation APIs and open-source technologies wherever possible.

2. EXACTLY TWO REFERENCE IMAGE INPUTS

The application must provide only two main image upload fields.

IMAGE INPUT 1: FULL BODY WITH FACE

This is the primary full-body reference.

Use it to understand:

- Overall body appearance.
- Body proportions.
- Clothing and accessories.
- Natural posture.
- Full-body composition.
- Visible physical characteristics.

IMAGE INPUT 2: FACE CLOSE-UP

This is the primary facial identity reference.

Use it to understand:

- Facial identity.
- Face shape.
- Eyes and eyebrows.
- Nose and lips.
- Hairstyle and hairline.
- Beard and moustache.
- Glasses.
- Natural skin texture.

DUAL REFERENCE INTELLIGENCE

Both uploaded images represent the same person.

The AI must intelligently combine both references into one consistent individual.

The close-up reference has priority for facial identity.

The full-body reference has priority for overall appearance, posture, and clothing.

Never treat these images as two separate individuals.

Do not randomly blend facial characteristics.

3. IMAGE FORMAT SELECTION

Provide a dedicated image-format selector.

Supported presets:

- 9:20 — Android Wallpaper.
- 9:16 — Portrait / Social Media.
- 4:5 — Portrait Photography.
- 1:1 — Square Image.
- 16:9 — Landscape.
- Custom Aspect Ratio, when supported.

Default selection: 9:20 Android Wallpaper.

Target Android Wallpaper Resolution: 1440 × 3200 pixels.

If the selected image API does not support the requested dimensions:

- Generate using the closest supported aspect ratio.
- Preserve the original composition.
- Use high-quality upscaling where available.
- Never stretch or distort the subject.
- Display the actual generated resolution.

4. ADVANCED FACE IDENTITY PRESERVATION

Implement reference-guided image generation with the strongest available identity-preservation features.

Priorities:

- Maintain recognizable facial identity.
- Preserve facial proportions.
- Preserve glasses and facial hair when present.
- Maintain natural skin texture.
- Avoid unnecessary facial changes.
- Minimize identity drift.
- Maintain consistent appearance across generated variations.

Target: Approximately 80% or higher facial similarity where technically achievable.

This is a target, not a guaranteed score.

Never display fake face accuracy percentages.

5. ADVANCED BENGALI & ENGLISH TYPOGRAPHY ENGINE

This is one of the most important features of the application.

The application must support accurate text placement inside generated images.

Supported languages:

- Bengali.
- English.
- Mixed Bengali and English.

The user must be able to enter exact text that should appear in the final image.

Typography Intelligence

Automatically analyze:

- Text meaning.
- Headline importance.
- Supporting text.
- Number of lines.
- Available composition space.
- Background contrast.
- Font suitability.
- Visual hierarchy.

LINE-BY-LINE DESIGN

Each line must be independently styled when appropriate.

Provide:

- Different font sizes for different lines.
- Different font weights.
- Separate text colors.
- Bold headlines.
- Elegant supporting text.
- Highlighted keywords.
- Controlled letter spacing.
- Proper line spacing.
- Balanced alignment.

Avoid using identical font sizes and colors for every line.

BENGALI FONT SUPPORT

Use properly licensed Bengali Unicode fonts.

Recommended font families:

- Noto Sans Bengali.
- Noto Serif Bengali.
- Hind Siliguri.
- SolaimanLipi, where licensing permits.
- Other properly licensed Bengali typefaces.

Ensure accurate Bengali vowel signs, conjunct letters, punctuation, and Unicode shaping.

ENGLISH FONT SUPPORT

Provide professional font options:

- Inter.
- Poppins.
- Montserrat.
- Playfair Display.
- Bebas Neue.
- Other properly licensed fonts.

Choose fonts according to the visual theme.

TEXT EFFECTS

Support:

- Gradient text.
- Soft shadows.
- Text outlines.
- Highlight backgrounds.
- Metallic text effects.
- Elegant borders.
- Subtle glow.
- Decorative separators.
- Professional typography graphics.

Do not overuse effects.

The final composition must remain elegant, readable, and professional.

6. GRAPHIC DESIGN & LAYOUT ENGINE

Treat the application as a professional graphic design studio.

Automatically arrange text and graphics according to the image composition.

Available layouts:

- Cinematic Poster.
- Editorial Portrait.
- Luxury Magazine Cover.
- Motivational Quote Poster.
- Modern Typography Poster.
- Minimalist Portrait.
- Bold Graphic Composition.
- Premium Social Media Design.

Design requirements:

- Keep text away from important facial features.
- Avoid overlapping text with the subject.
- Maintain visual balance.
- Use suitable negative space.
- Maintain strong contrast.
- Use appropriate margins.
- Ensure mobile-screen readability.

7. EXACT TEXT ACCURACY

This requirement is critical.

The AI must never rewrite, misspell, invent, or automatically change user-provided text.

Implement a dedicated text-rendering system using SVG, Canvas, or another reliable typography renderer.

Recommended workflow:

1. Generate the background and portrait.
2. Receive the exact user-provided text.
3. Render text separately using suitable fonts.
4. Apply line-by-line typography styling.
5. Composite the text and graphics onto the image.
6. Produce the final high-resolution image.

The user must be able to edit the text before final rendering.

If the user requests an image without text, do not add any unwanted text.

8. CINEMATIC IMAGE GENERATION

Provide premium visual styles:

- Photorealistic Portrait.
- Cinematic Photography.
- Luxury Editorial.
- Professional Studio Portrait.
- Natural Outdoor Photography.
- Dark Cinematic.
- Dramatic Lighting.
- Golden Hour.
- Artistic Portrait.
- Modern Fashion Photography.

Automatically optimize:

- Lighting.
- Camera perspective.
- Background.
- Depth of field.
- Color grading.
- Composition.
- Natural shadows.
- Subject separation.
- Image detail.

Preserve realistic facial appearance.

9. SMART BENGALI PROMPT ENGINE

The user should be able to describe the desired image in Bengali.

Example:

"আমার ছবিটি দিয়ে একটি সুন্দর সিনেমাটিক পোস্টার তৈরি করো। উপরে বড় বাংলা শিরোনাম থাকবে, নিচে ছোট ইংরেজি লেখা থাকবে। প্রতিটি লাইনে আলাদা রং এবং প্রফেশনাল ফন্ট ব্যবহার করবে।"

The AI should understand the instruction and convert it into an optimized image-generation and graphic-design workflow.

Preserve the original meaning of all user instructions.

10. MOBILE-FIRST INTERFACE

Design a premium dark-themed responsive interface for Android smartphones.

Main sections:

1. Full Body + Face Image Upload.
2. Face Close-up Image Upload.
3. Reference Image Preview.
4. Bengali / English Prompt Input.
5. Exact Text Input.
6. Image Aspect Ratio Selector.
7. Cinematic Style Selector.
8. Typography Style Selector.
9. Generate Image Button.
10. Generation Progress.
11. Final Image Preview.
12. Download PNG / JPEG.

Use large touch-friendly controls and clear Bengali labels.

11. FREE API & SECURITY

- Prioritize genuinely available free-tier image-generation APIs.
- Select APIs that support reference-image conditioning.
- Verify whether dual-reference input is supported.
- Use open-source alternatives where suitable.
- Do not assume all free services support every requested feature.
- Keep private API keys on the backend.
- Handle rate limits and temporary API failures.
- Provide clear error messages.
- Never simulate successful image generation.

12. FINAL EXPORT

Provide:

- PNG export.
- High-quality JPEG export.
- Requested aspect ratio.
- High-resolution output when supported.
- Accurate Bengali and English typography.
- Android-compatible download.
- Meaningful filenames.

13. FINAL ACCEPTANCE REQUIREMENTS

The project is complete only when:

1. Exactly two reference-image inputs are available.
2. Both images are interpreted as the same person.
3. Facial identity is preserved as closely as the model allows.
4. Multiple image formats are supported.
5. Bengali and English text can be rendered accurately.
6. Each text line can have independent styling.
7. Font size, weight, color, and spacing are controlled.
8. Text is readable on mobile screens.
9. Generated images are genuine AI outputs.
10. The final image can be downloaded successfully.
11. The application works smoothly on Android browsers.

FINAL VISION

Build a professional AI Personal Wallpaper & Graphic Design Studio that combines advanced dual-reference identity preservation, photorealistic image generation, cinematic composition, and high-quality Bengali and English typography.

The final result must look like a professionally designed premium poster or wallpaper, not an ordinary AI-generated image.
